    "id": "cod-warzone",
    "name": "Call of Duty: Warzone - uses Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4’s measurement",
    "needsCalibration": false,
    "sources": [
      {
        "what": "Measured on 2026-11-13 by EXO Studio's Curve Lab (D666) from the PC: the Core drove the right stick over its USB link (ZSI) and the capture card's pictures were read by phase correlation (1 run, playstation at 1280x720). Confidence medium (79/100): the 360s differ by 0.76 %; one run only: nothing to compare it with."
      },
      {
        "what": "Degrees from whole turns: 1333.1 strip px per 360 (the view 119.5 deg across, never used by the translator)."
      },
      {
        "what": "Dead zone 0.0830 (ramp 0.1142, fitted 0.0830 adopted); full stick 508.7 deg/s; curve 15 measured points (worst miss 0.0 % of a point, half a stick step allowed)."
      },
      {
        "what": "Pitch 0.340 x yaw at equal stick; the view pitches 0 deg in all."
      },
      {
        "what": "Dead zone shape radial: nudged 1 % at a time, a 45 deg push first moved the view at 0.129 against 0.114 straight (round x1.0, cross x1.41)."
      },
      {
        "what": "Turn ramp: none (full holds up to 3.5 s turn at one speed)."
      },
      {
        "what": "Step 1 at look sensitivity 1.00, step 2 at 4.00: four sticks 3.961-3.997 x (median 3.991); full stick 531.4 deg/s at 1.00, 2120.7 at 4.00 (pairs of holds, left 2117.3 / right 2124.1)."
      },
      {
        "what": "Dead zone 0.114 by the picture (still 0.110, moving 0.118; PS stick steps 0.0079); the curve's points re-based onto it."
      },
      {
        "what": "Aiming down sights at sens 4.00, FOV 120 (ADS FOV Affected): 0.2390 / 0.2389 / 0.2415 / 0.2385 x hip at sticks 0.472 / 0.551 / 0.630 / 1.0, full 505.8 deg/s by whole turns. Up/down 0.340 x left/right. No turn ramp, no outer dead zone."
      },
      {
        "what": "FOV (measured 2026-11-13): hip turn rates x tan(FOV/2)/tan(60 deg) (FOV 100: 0.689 measured at 4 sticks, the rule 0.688); aiming falls faster: FOV 100 = 0.610 x FOV 120 (308.8 deg/s), a fit of (that ratio)^1.32 between FOV 100 and 120. The model's fov block is added once the app accepts it (D697/D700)."
      },
      {
        "what": "Replaces the preset's earlier model (\"Modern Warfare 4 (Linear) - SEEDED FROM BLACK OPS 7, NOT MEASURED\", not measured), kept in docs/calibration/cod-mw4-replaced-2026-11-13.json."
      },
      {
        "what": "D714: Call of Duty: Warzone aims exactly as Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 (owner, 2026-11-13): this is game pack \"cod-mw4\" version 3’s model, shared, not measured again. A re-measure of Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 is this game’s too."
      }
